          %h3#ConcreteObjects Concrete objects
          %p
            The cohesive structure on an object in a cohesive
            = succeed "-topos" do
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
