              is a fiber of the
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/free+loop+space+object"} free loop space object
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %mi ℒ
                    %mi A
                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} \mathcal{L} A
              and that this may equivalently be computed by the
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/%28%E2%88%9E%2C1%29-powering"} (∞,1)-powering
              = succeed "," do
