              of the base space as on the left of the diagram. Pulling this back upwards through the diagram and using the pasting law and the definition of
              = succeed "s" do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/loop+space+object"} loop space object
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
