          #CollectingTwistedCohomologyForDifferentTwists.num_note
            %h6#note Note
            %p
              In applications one is typically interested in situations where the
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/characteristic+class"} characteristic class
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %mo{:stretchy => "false"} [
                    %mstyle{:mathvariant => "bold"}
                      %mi c
                    %mo{:stretchy => "false"} ]
