          %p
            The material to go here is at
            = succeed "." do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/schreiber/show/differential+cohomology+in+a+cohesive+topos"} Schreiber, section 2.3.7
          %p (…)
          %h3#Concordance Concordance
          %p
            Since
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
              %semantics
                %mrow
                  %mstyle{:mathvariant => "bold"}
                    %mi H
                %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} \mathbf{H}
            is an
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/%28%E2%88%9E%2C1%29-topos"} (∞,1)-topos
            it carries canonically the structure of a
            = succeed "." do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/cartesian+closed+%28%E2%88%9E%2C1%29-category"} cartesian closed (∞,1)-category
            %br/
            = succeed "," do
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %mi X
                    %mo ,
                    %mi Y
                    %mo ∈
                    %mstyle{:mathvariant => "bold"}
                      %mi H
                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} X, Y \in \mathbf{H}
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
              %semantics
                %mrow
                  %msup
                    %mi Y
                    %mi X
